ot Annotation**, **Few-shot Annotation**, and **Cross-modal Retrieval**.\n\nOverall, the figure depicts a computational biology / single-cell omics model pipeline that integrates scRNA-seq gene expression data with textual cell descriptions for cross-modal pretraining and downstream cell analysis tasks."]}

